{
  "Npcs.BazaarGatekeeper.Desc": "This crimson-skinned demon-morph guarding the entrance to Bizarre Bazaar stands ten feet tall. He has red skin and is wearing an almost sky-blue turban on his head. He has solid black eyes. He is wearing a simple tunic and loose-fitting pants. He is wielding a pair of scimitars."
  "Npcs.BazaarGatekeeper.Name": "guard"
}
